     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "The X1-010 is a 16-voice sound generator: each channel takes its waveform from RAM, 128 bytes of 8-bit signed data, or samples 8-bit signed PCM.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "15-17",
       "sha": "f2695ec38c0294ccbce1bbcf36a8734d214fc50504ed9ed9a9c7de3561488b84"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "It is a Seta custom sound chip in an 80-pin PQFP, a custom programmed Mitsubishi M60016 gate array of 3608 gates.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "11-13",
       "sha": "5e036082538cf0a94d0b8d34fc0aaeec9f55a7773688e85b257f4c567cd23daa"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "reset",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "MAME has no reset: device_start zeroes the 0x2000-byte register area and each channel's sample and envelope offsets once.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "111-115",
       "sha": "18096b89ac5e156526069e81558bc1dba0b2bd902bd5c363063d29e28d5f5c10"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "122-123",
       "sha": "c01973e7d759bc4ee42e2052a7f07049640222f321363a92f91f4ae585049dbb"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "The output rate is the clock divided by 512, and is set again when the clock changes.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "108-109",
       "sha": "19cf325a0c119c5e8bbea1641acfaa4d913dad0e33098a868e86959dcdd3c1db"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "141-144",
       "sha": "4af428ab9b00d4b189385b48437b2e5e431c933fdd10197cd95ab25b3e1699d9"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "The sound stream has no inputs and two outputs.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "120",
       "sha": "23dbf9601cc4ae8b5eb9068d7fdb1a7723dabe86f4f64ce0ba1b4340a0c2adb4"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "A change of the ROM bank brings the sound stream up to date first.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/x1_010.cpp",
       "lines": "154",
       "sha": "48354aa610673f513dcaecec9b3ac500531bc608b6049698da7d77a5d11a2933"
